#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:11 552d7d7718a04a26833d852dc767becf
msgid "创建项目"
msgstr "Create a project"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:13 f4874162073049519bc67bf5665213ec
msgid ""
"neptrain workflow init \\\n"
"  --profile slurm \\\n"
"  --ensemble npt \\\n"
"  --dft-backend vasp \\\n"
"  --directory fe-project\n"
"cd fe-project\n"
"neptrain doctor --project project.yaml\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:23 630b2a18bbce4c31883e3560650d9a93
msgid ""
"项目只接受 `schema_version: 8`。自动采样只读取 `sampling.routes`，不再接受 全局 "
"`md.structures`、`md.template_path`、`sampling.conditions` 或 "
"`sampling.progression`，也不在运行时迁移旧配置。"
msgstr ""
"Projects accept only `schema_version: 8`. Automated sampling reads only "
"`sampling.routes`; global `md.structures`, `md.template_path`, "
"`sampling.conditions`, and `sampling.progression` are no longer accepted,"
" and legacy configuration is not migrated at runtime."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:27 c0024f147c9649abb95a3ff15d1dec18
msgid "当前配置职责如下："
msgstr "Configuration responsibilities are:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:29 5fa4eaf763fb485497f2d41ceddecbaa
msgid "`md`：选择 LAMMPS/GPUMD 和推理后端。"
msgstr "`md`: select LAMMPS or GPUMD and the inference backend."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:30 b07235359e174ebfb1fe20648e65cc1c
msgid "`labeling`：选择 VASP、ABACUS 或微调后的等变 Teacher 模型。"
msgstr ""
"`labeling`: select VASP, ABACUS, or a fine-tuned equivariant teacher "
"model."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:31 196ccca05961406693a20155e2d1ddf4
msgid "`sampling.routes`：每条采样路径显式绑定结构、模板和温度路径。"
msgstr ""
"`sampling.routes`: bind structures, a template, and a temperature path "
"explicitly for each sampling route."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:32 4509c65209214937971b90e7af44bccf
msgid "`sampling.candidate_pool` / `sampling.selection`：可选的高级覆盖项。"
msgstr ""
"`sampling.candidate_pool` / `sampling.selection`: optional advanced "
"overrides."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:33 0f72001fe8b543e3b7dc0d60ff4a44c4
msgid ""
"LAMMPS 模板：物理过程、`timestep`、阻尼、spin 积分参数和 dump 频率。 内置模板使用 `{{ dump_interval"
" }}`：短轨迹约保留 100 帧，长轨迹最多每 1000 步输出一帧。自定义模板可以复用该变量，也可以显式固定间隔。"
msgstr ""
"LAMMPS templates define the physical process, `timestep`, damping, spin "
"integration parameters, and dump frequency. Built-in templates use `{{ "
"dump_interval }}` to retain about 100 frames for short trajectories and "
"write at most one frame every 1,000 steps for long trajectories. Custom "
"templates may reuse this variable or set a fixed interval explicitly."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:36 46df7d4a61664c75bba975c8f62d9caa
msgid "`execution.targets.*.setup_script`：module、Python 环境和 LAMMPS plugin。"
msgstr ""
"`execution.targets.*.setup_script`: modules, Python environment, and the "
"LAMMPS plugin."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:38 95315c119cb44e6588dd7c7a41babaa0
msgid ""
"`workflow init` 默认只生成当前选择的 `lammps.in` 和标注后端输入，不再生成四套 LAMMPS "
"模板及两种第一性原理输入。Spin 流程使用 `--spin --dft-backend abacus`。"
msgstr ""
"By default, `workflow init` generates only the selected `lammps.in` and "
"labeling-backend input instead of four LAMMPS templates and both first-"
"principles inputs. For a spin workflow, use `--spin --dft-backend "
"abacus`."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:42 7840c9198999403e955357069dbea7cd
msgid "最小 route 只需要："
msgstr "A minimal route needs only:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:44 d5dc3dfb00864463bf3f6f00e081aa8b
msgid ""
"sampling:\n"
"  routes:\n"
"    - id: default\n"
"      structures: [./structures]\n"
"      template_path: ./lammps.in\n"
"      conditions:\n"
"        temperature_path: [300, 600, 900]\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:54 50da29545eed4d9bac8f905c4f912603
msgid ""
"省略项采用一套固定默认值：压强为 `0`，全部温度都是生产温度，FPS 每轮最多 选择 `100` 个结构，炸前帧和坏尾帧分别为 `2` 和 "
"`1`。默认递进策略为："
msgstr ""
"Omitted settings use fixed defaults: pressure is `0`, every temperature "
"is a production temperature, FPS selects at most `100` structures per "
"round, and the pre-failure and bad-tail windows are `2` and `1` frames. "
"The default progression is:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:57 584cedc6056d430a9bb9e6295b6b5497
msgid ""
"progression:\n"
"  steps:\n"
"    smoke_passed: 10000\n"
"    short_stable: 40000\n"
"    long_stable: 160000\n"
"    production_ready: 640000\n"
"  replicas:\n"
"    smoke_passed: 1\n"
"    short_stable: 1\n"
"    long_stable: 2\n"
"    production_ready: 3\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:71 7dc318d7d28d4b1cb5ce173bab3de877
msgid "只有需要改变这些值时才写进项目。一个 workflow 也可以配置多条 route："
msgstr ""
"Add these values to the project only when you need to change them. A "
"workflow may also define multiple routes:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:73 257373534db8472a904b5be86f58e6ad
msgid ""
"sampling:\n"
"  routes:\n"
"    - id: route_a\n"
"      structures: [./structures/a.xyz]\n"
"      template_path: ./templates/a.in\n"
"      conditions:\n"
"        temperature_path: [300, 600, 900]\n"
"    - id: route_b\n"
"      structures: [./structures/b.xyz]\n"
"      template_path: ./templates/b.in\n"
"      conditions:\n"
"        temperature_path: [500, 1000, 1500]\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:88 8afe6e57d3f1444d92444619434a7259
msgid ""
"一个 workflow 会调度全部 route。同一个结构可以显式出现在多条 route 中； `route_id` "
"和内容指纹会隔离场景成熟度与恢复结果。高级 route 可以显式覆盖 `production_temperatures`、`pressure` "
"和整套 `progression`。"
msgstr ""
"One workflow schedules every route. A structure may explicitly appear in "
"multiple routes; `route_id` and the content fingerprint isolate scenario "
"maturity and recovery results. Advanced routes may override "
"`production_temperatures`, `pressure`, and the complete `progression`."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:92 5af2071e457945f39f42391733c75cdb
msgid "需要在飞书群中接收每轮完成和流程终态时，在 `project.yaml` 直接配置自定义 机器人："
msgstr ""
"To receive generation-completion and terminal workflow notifications in a"
" Feishu group, configure a custom bot directly in `project.yaml`:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:95 c72ccb4b26054e47b9fa79322c282d9b
msgid ""
"notifications:\n"
"  feishu:\n"
"    webhook: https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/bot/v2/hook/REPLACE\n"
"    secret: REPLACE\n"
"    timeout_seconds: 5\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:103 eeee7c49fcf24c6eba144001fb07aa79
msgid ""
"`neptrain doctor --project project.yaml` 会真实发送一条测试消息，同时验证网络、 "
"签名和飞书响应。Controller 运行时只把通知事件放入后台线程；网络超时、签名失败、 飞书拒绝或通知状态文件异常均不会改变 workflow"
" 状态、退出码或科学 ledger。 每个已接受 generation 报告采样、选样、标注、训练集变化和验证 RMSE；流程完成、 "
"失败、评估拒绝、停滞或预算耗尽另发终态消息。投递去重和结果保存在 `.neptrain/notifications.json`，`neptrain"
" workflow status` 会显示其健康状态。 每条进度和终态消息都会显示 workflow 名称与绝对路径，便于区分并发运行的任务。"
msgstr ""
"`neptrain doctor --project project.yaml` sends a real test message and "
"validates network access, the signature, and Feishu's response. During a "
"run, the Controller places notification events on a background thread. "
"Network timeouts, signature errors, Feishu rejections, or a damaged "
"notification state file never change the workflow state, exit code, or "
"scientific ledger. Each accepted generation reports sampling, selection, "
"labeling, training-set changes, and validation RMSE. Completion, failure,"
" evaluation rejection, stagnation, and budget exhaustion produce separate"
" terminal messages. Delivery deduplication and results are stored in "
"`.neptrain/notifications.json`, whose health is shown by `neptrain "
"workflow status`. Every progress and terminal message includes the "
"workflow name and absolute path so concurrent runs are easy to "
"distinguish."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:111 0e26793dfa4d4edfaddb8f0dacf8c5fa
msgid "Slurm 分析任务需要随候选池增长保留内存余量时，可以给独立 analysis target 配置有上限的内存阶梯："
msgstr ""
"When a Slurm analysis task needs memory headroom as the candidate pool "
"grows, configure a bounded memory ladder on a dedicated analysis target:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:114 64755ae1994d45e5acefc7479f4828b5
msgid ""
"execution:\n"
"  stage_targets:\n"
"    analysis: analysis-cpu\n"
"  targets:\n"
"    analysis-cpu:\n"
"      executor: slurm\n"
"      partition: cpu\n"
"      cpus_per_task: 1\n"
"      memory_ladder: [4G, 8G, 16G]\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:126 8d7c1b66bdb54aa0839a65e6a8d2ad37
msgid ""
"第一次提交使用 4G。只有 `select` 因 Slurm OOM 失败时，Controller 才会自动创建 可追踪的新 "
"attempt，并依次使用 8G、16G；达到最后一级仍失败时流程正常进入 `failed`，不会无限重试。不要同时在 `directives` "
"中再写 `--mem`。"
msgstr ""
"The first submission uses 4G. Only when `select` fails because of a Slurm"
" OOM does the Controller create a traceable new attempt and advance to "
"8G, then 16G. If the last level still fails, the workflow enters `failed`"
" normally instead of retrying indefinitely. Do not also specify `--mem` "
"in `directives`."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:130 dd2c4fdd64544e818c16b026b401cd92
msgid ""
"默认情况下，全部 route 使用 `execution.stage_targets.sampling`。需要把某条 route 送到另一台 "
"Slurm 平台时，只写例外映射："
msgstr ""
"By default, every route uses `execution.stage_targets.sampling`. To send "
"one route to another Slurm platform, add only the exception mapping:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:133 86da54035147458e8e11cb3210a1869a
msgid ""
"execution:\n"
"  stage_targets:\n"
"    training: train\n"
"    sampling: md-default\n"
"    labeling: label\n"
"    analysis: cpu\n"
"  sampling_route_targets:\n"
"    route_b: md-remote\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:144 5c8122b5ab7042ed8c50e3fb975f4ae1
msgid ""
"NepTrain 只向 LAMMPS 模板注入 `temperature`、`pressure`、`steps`、`seed`、 "
"`replica`、`model_file`、`structure_file` 和输出路径等变量，不管理 "
"`plugin_path`，也不判断模板是 FIRE、NVT/NPT、spin MD、MC+MD 还是 chemical "
"swap。物理过程、阻尼、积分器和 spin 参数都由模板决定。"
msgstr ""
"NepTrain injects only variables such as `temperature`, `pressure`, "
"`steps`, `seed`, `replica`, `model_file`, `structure_file`, and output "
"paths into a LAMMPS template. It does not manage `plugin_path` or decide "
"whether the template implements FIRE, NVT/NPT, spin MD, MC+MD, or "
"chemical swaps. The template owns the physical process, damping, "
"integrator, and spin parameters."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:149 16d4fe5a9adc4fb48363da96795df389
msgid ""
"选择 `md.backend: gpumd` 时，route 的 `template_path` 指向 GPUMD `run.in`。 "
"NepTrain 支持模板中的 `nve`，并保留模板选择的 `nvt_*`/`npt_*` 方法、耦合 常数、`time_step` 和 "
"dump 间隔，更新本轮模型、初始温度、步数与确定性 velocity seed；对 `npt_ber` 和 `npt_scr` 还会按模板的 "
"isotropic、orthorhombic 或 triclinic 形式写入目标压强 （GPa）。GPUMD 与 LAMMPS "
"共用轨迹健康检查和失败窗口契约。Spin workflow 仍明确使用 LAMMPS DynSpin。"
msgstr ""
"With `md.backend: gpumd`, the route’s `template_path` points to a GPUMD "
"`run.in`. NepTrain supports `nve` and preserves the template-selected "
"`nvt_*`/`npt_*` method, coupling constants, `time_step`, and dump "
"interval while updating the current model, initial temperature, step "
"count, and deterministic velocity seed. For `npt_ber` and `npt_scr`, it "
"also writes the target pressure in GPa using the template’s isotropic, "
"orthorhombic, or triclinic form. GPUMD and LAMMPS share the trajectory-"
"health and failure-window contract. Spin workflows still use LAMMPS "
"DynSpin explicitly."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:157 9d2445bf883b4adc9d9675ece4f7af21
msgid ""
"每条 route 的 `conditions.temperature_path` 是有顺序的温度探路路径。例如 `[300, 500, 700, "
"900]` 会先验证 300 K，只有通过后才解锁 500 K。 默认全部温度都会跑到最长时长。显式设置 "
"`production_temperatures` 后，未列入 其中的中间温度只做低成本 smoke 探路。"
msgstr ""
"Each route’s `conditions.temperature_path` is an ordered temperature-"
"probing path. For example, `[300, 500, 700, 900]` validates 300 K first "
"and unlocks 500 K only after it passes. By default every temperature "
"proceeds to the longest duration. When `production_temperatures` is set "
"explicitly, intermediate temperatures not in that list run only the low-"
"cost smoke probe."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:162 30ce444756f54ae186eba5848c49b1b8
msgid ""
"一个温压条件在本档 replica 正常结束并通过轨迹健康与诊断检查后晋级。FPS 覆盖度 "
"独立决定哪些结构需要标注：发现新颖结构会触发标注和重训，但不会迫使健康轨迹反复 停留在同一时长。晋级后，Controller "
"同时解锁下一个温度和当前生产温度的下一档 时长。模型更新不会把已经完成的 smoke、short 或 long 证据清零，只有最终 "
"production 认证需要绑定当前模型哈希。`progression.replicas` 控制各时长需要的 独立 MD 次数。"
msgstr ""
"A temperature-pressure condition advances after the replicas at its "
"current duration finish normally and pass trajectory health and "
"diagnostic checks. FPS coverage independently determines which structures"
" need labels: novel structures trigger labeling and retraining, but do "
"not force healthy trajectories to repeat the same duration. Advancement "
"unlocks both the next temperature and the next duration for the current "
"production temperature. Model updates do not erase completed smoke, "
"short, or long evidence. Only final production certification is bound to "
"the current model hash. `progression.replicas` controls the number of "
"independent MD runs required at each duration."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:169 eab36d72bedc43a09b29f0f153020298
msgid ""
"所有通过健康检查的 dump 帧都会参与全局选择。FPS 先按精确元素集合分组，只用 相同元素集合的当前 `train.xyz` 做 warm "
"start；每个仍有新颖结构的温压条件先保留 一个锚点，剩余名额完全按全局 novelty 分配。已经学好的低温条件不会再被等额配满， "
"高温或新解锁条件可以取得大部分预算。FPS 使用结构级 NEP descriptor；可选择原有的 "
"全原子平均，也可选择按元素规约的均值与标准差通道，但都不把它描述成逐原子局域 新颖度。"
msgstr ""
"Every dump frame that passes health checks participates in global "
"selection. FPS first groups frames by exact element set and warm-starts "
"each group only from matching structures in the current `train.xyz`. "
"Every temperature-pressure condition that still has novel structures "
"receives one anchor; all remaining seats are allocated by global novelty."
" Mature low-temperature conditions are no longer filled to an equal "
"quota, so high-temperature or newly unlocked conditions can receive most "
"of the budget. FPS uses structure-level NEP descriptors. It can retain "
"the historical all-atom mean or use element-wise mean and standard-"
"deviation channels, but neither mode is presented as per-atom local "
"novelty."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:176 6863f9714fc54d8fba7d51e3322219cc
msgid ""
"NepTrain 只在 FPS 前去除训练集已有结构和同一 route 内的完全重复结构，不按固定 stride "
"抽帧，也不使用候选数量上限提前裁剪。 `sampling.selection.max_selected` 是每个采样轮最多送去 Label "
"Adapter 的结构数， 不是必须填满的配额。`novelty: auto` 只用当前 `train.xyz` 中的同元素结构拟合描述符 "
"中心和逐特征尺度，再从训练集留一最近邻距离估计保守阈值。候选结构只使用该变换， "
"不参与尺度拟合；因此极端候选不会反向压低阈值。候选低于训练集已有分辨率时不送 DFT。若本轮一个结构也选不到， workflow 会跳过 "
"Label Adapter 和重训，直接记录覆盖证据并推进下一档采样，而不是 报错或提交空的 VASP/ABACUS "
"作业。需要固定策略时，可显式设置 `selection_threshold` 和 `completion_threshold`。"
msgstr ""
"Before FPS, NepTrain removes only structures already present in the "
"training set and exact duplicates within the same route. It does not "
"subsample by a fixed stride or truncate candidates before descriptor "
"calculation. `sampling.selection.max_selected` is a ceiling, not a quota "
"that must be filled. With `novelty: auto`, NepTrain fits the descriptor "
"center and per-feature scale using only matching-element structures from "
"the current `train.xyz`, then estimates a conservative threshold from "
"leave-one-out nearest-neighbour distances in that training set. "
"Candidates are transformed with the fitted coordinates but do not "
"influence them, so an extreme candidate cannot lower the threshold. "
"Candidates below the training set's existing resolution are not sent to "
"DFT. If no structure is selected, the workflow skips the Label Adapter "
"and retraining, records the coverage evidence, and advances the sampling "
"ladder instead of failing or submitting empty VASP/ABACUS jobs. For a "
"fixed policy, set `selection_threshold` and `completion_threshold` "
"explicitly."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:187 e3a65613f8bb4ef18b2d2b5b489a7e44
msgid "多元素体系建议明确选择按元素规约："
msgstr "For multi-element systems, explicitly select element-wise reduction:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:189 6b366a3e6e0c4086a0556d0c98e19dfb
msgid ""
"sampling:\n"
"  selection:\n"
"    descriptor_reduction: elementwise_mean_std\n"
"    max_selected: 100\n"
"    novelty: auto\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:197 bf45e8daa39c4c7193b1c95b2ac0d793
msgid "`descriptor_reduction` 有两个值："
msgstr "`descriptor_reduction` accepts two values:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:199 a614b56e96f5405cb8a87ab78a65bd26
msgid "`global_mean`：默认值，保留原有的全原子描述符平均；"
msgstr ""
"`global_mean`: the default, preserving the historical all-atom descriptor"
" mean;"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:200 431358c1a2f84aa9bea1deb3967da236
msgid "`elementwise_mean_std`：按稳定元素顺序拼接每种元素的描述符均值和标准差， 避免少数元素或不同元素的变化在总平均中被冲淡。"
msgstr ""
"`elementwise_mean_std`: concatenates each element's descriptor mean and "
"standard deviation in a stable element order, so minority-element or "
"element-specific changes are not diluted by the global mean."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:203 1bb745059a70463093bf4e1e49bade9b
msgid ""
"候选结构、完整 `train.xyz`、自动 novelty 阈值与 FPS 使用同一种规约。切换规约后， 旧规约下的绝对 novelty "
"阈值不能直接复用；`novelty: auto` 会重新按当前训练集估计。"
msgstr ""
"Candidates, the complete `train.xyz`, the automatic novelty threshold, "
"and FPS all use the same reduction. Absolute novelty thresholds from "
"another reduction cannot be reused; `novelty: auto` re-estimates the "
"threshold from the current training set."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:206 15724119d586479f943bb0c830fd7374
msgid ""
"novelty 只回答“这个结构在描述符空间里是否值得送 DFT”，不能单独证明势函数精度 已经收敛。需要自动停止时，可让 workflow "
"检查旧模型在本轮新 DFT 标签上的真实 误差；这些结构尚未参与本轮重训，因此可作为在线 acquisition canary："
msgstr ""
"Novelty answers only whether a structure is worth sending to DFT in "
"descriptor space; by itself it cannot prove that potential accuracy has "
"converged. For automatic stopping, the workflow can check the old model's"
" actual errors against the new DFT labels from the current generation. "
"Because these structures have not yet entered retraining, they act as an "
"online acquisition canary:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:210 d23b3c717db14be8b0fcec483ebe03dc
msgid ""
"workflow:\n"
"  max_model_generations: 24\n"
"  convergence:\n"
"    acquisition_min_r2:\n"
"      energy_r2: 0.95\n"
"      force_r2: 0.95\n"
"      virial_r2: 0.90\n"
"    group_min_force_r2: 0.90\n"
"    min_selected: 50\n"
"    max_outlier_fraction: 0.05\n"
"    acquisition_max_rmse:\n"
"      energy_rmse: 0.01    # 可选的绝对误差安全上限，eV/atom\n"
"      force_rmse: 0.15     # eV/Å\n"
"      virial_rmse: 0.10    # eV/atom\n"
"    consecutive_generations: 1\n"
msgstr ""
"workflow:\n"
"  max_model_generations: 24\n"
"  convergence:\n"
"    acquisition_min_r2:\n"
"      energy_r2: 0.95\n"
"      force_r2: 0.95\n"
"      virial_r2: 0.90\n"
"    group_min_force_r2: 0.90\n"
"    min_selected: 50\n"
"    max_outlier_fraction: 0.05\n"
"    acquisition_max_rmse:\n"
"      energy_rmse: 0.01    # optional absolute-error safety cap, eV/atom\n"
"      force_rmse: 0.15     # eV/A\n"
"      virial_rmse: 0.10    # eV/atom\n"
"    consecutive_generations: 1\n"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:228 2a1d241bc7e9448bb3e1ace602954470
msgid ""
"这套判据只使用“本轮 FPS 选出的最远结构、DFT 标注之后、并入训练集之前”的旧模型 "
"预测，避免拿训练过同一批结构的模型证明自己收敛。默认要求至少 50 个有效标签；整批 Energy/Force/Virial 的 R²、每个元素的"
" Force R²、每个实际温压条件的 Force R² 都要 过线，同时三倍参考标准差之外的残差比例不能超过 "
"`max_outlier_fraction`。对常量切片， 完全一致记为 R²=1，否则记为 "
"0，避免未定义值被误判为通过。`acquisition_max_rmse` 是可选的绝对误差安全上限，适合与 R² "
"联用，防止高方差数据仅靠相关性过关。"
msgstr ""
"This gate uses only predictions from the old model on the structures "
"farthest from the training set that FPS selected in the current generation, "
"after DFT labeling but before those labels enter training. A model therefore "
"cannot prove convergence on data it has already seen. By default, at least "
"50 valid labels are required. Batch energy, force, and virial R-squared, "
"per-element force R-squared, and force R-squared for every sampled temperature-"
"pressure condition must all pass. The fraction of residuals beyond three "
"reference standard deviations must also stay below `max_outlier_fraction`. "
"For a constant-reference slice, an exact match is assigned R-squared=1 and "
"any mismatch R-squared=0, so an undefined value cannot pass accidentally. "
"`acquisition_max_rmse` is an optional absolute-error safety cap that can be "
"combined with R-squared to keep high-variance data from passing on correlation alone."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:235 1bf3d36bea8e474dba582b0f0ff264ff
msgid ""
"这批结构本身已经是相对训练集的 FPS 最远点，因此默认一代通过即可；确实担心 DFT 样本波动时才把 "
"`consecutive_generations` 调大。workflow 还要求所有生产温压条件已到 "
"`production_ready`，因此低温的一次好结果不会提前终止高温探索。这里没有适用于所有 "
"体系的固定阈值：上例是通用起点，声子、弹性或高精度热力学任务仍应使用面向目标性质 的独立验证集。能量和 virial 的 RMSE 单位为 "
"`eV/atom`，力为 `eV/Å`。"
msgstr ""
"These structures are already the FPS points farthest from the training set, "
"so one passing generation is the default. Increase `consecutive_generations` "
"only when DFT sampling variability is a real concern. The workflow also "
"requires every production temperature-pressure condition to reach "
"`production_ready`, so one good low-temperature result cannot stop high-"
"temperature exploration early. No fixed threshold suits every system: this "
"example is a general starting point, while phonon, elastic, or high-accuracy "
"thermodynamic work should still use a target-specific independent validation "
"set. Energy and virial RMSE use `eV/atom`; force RMSE uses `eV/Å`."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:241 d5be0988e0214e5986b7a0f282e9dd4c
msgid ""
"未配置 `workflow.convergence` 且没有独立验证的流程仍会停在 "
"`coverage_exhausted`：它只表示当前描述符和采样路径已找不到覆盖缺口，不等价于 模型已经通过物理精度验证。"
msgstr ""
"A workflow without `workflow.convergence` or independent validation still"
" stops at `coverage_exhausted`. This means only that the current "
"descriptor and sampling path no longer reveal a coverage gap; it does not"
" mean the model has passed a physical accuracy validation."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:245 d76dbfc8e53847f395d88c897b4a96f5
msgid ""
"这里的“一代”严格绑定一个模型哈希。采样代按 `train → evaluate → explore → select → label → "
"diagnose → merge` 推进：先用上一代 合并后的完整训练集得到新模型，再让这个模型驱动本代 MD。Controller "
"会枚举该模型下所有已解锁 scenario attempt，并把它们作为独立 process/Slurm 任务一次性提交；全部进入终态后 "
"再合并候选并执行 FPS。不同 route 可通过 `execution.sampling_route_targets` "
"送到不同平台。所有候选必须由同一个模型产生；候选池 manifest 和每个 extxyz 帧都会记录 "
"`sampling_model_sha256`。旧模型轨迹不能混入新模型候选池。"
msgstr ""
"A generation is strictly bound to one model hash. An acquisition generation "
"runs `train -> evaluate -> explore -> select -> label -> diagnose -> merge`: "
"it first trains a new model on the complete dataset merged by the previous "
"generation, then uses that model for the current MD. The Controller enumerates "
"all unlocked scenario attempts for that model and submits them together as "
"independent process or Slurm tasks. It merges candidates and runs FPS only "
"after every task reaches a terminal state. Routes may use different platforms "
"through `execution.sampling_route_targets`. Every candidate must come from "
"the same model; the candidate-pool manifest and each extxyz frame record "
"`sampling_model_sha256`. Trajectories from an old model cannot enter a new "
"model's candidate pool."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:253 e19f2550ee5d446e8e0c0650a61bddcc
msgid ""
"采样判据通过后，本代仍会先合并最后一批 DFT 标签，但不会把已看过这些标签的模型 用于收敛判断。Controller 随后创建一个 "
"`finalization` 代，只执行 `train → evaluate`：在最终完整训练集上训练并验收最终模型，不再运行 MD、FPS 或 "
"DFT。 `complete` 只由这个终代产生。为保证最后一个采样代也能自动完成，准备 workflow 时会 在 "
"`max_model_generations` 个采样预算之外预留一个终代；若采样预算用尽仍未通过，预留 代不会被误用作普通采样。"
msgstr ""
"After the acquisition gate passes, the generation still merges the final DFT "
"labels, but a model that has already seen those labels is never used as "
"convergence evidence. The Controller then creates a `finalization` generation "
"that runs only `train -> evaluate`: it trains and accepts the final model on "
"the complete final dataset, without MD, FPS, or DFT. Only this finalization "
"generation can produce `complete`. To let the last acquisition generation "
"finish automatically, workflow preparation reserves one finalization generation "
"beyond the `max_model_generations` acquisition budget. If that budget is "
"exhausted without passing, the reserved generation is never reused for sampling."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:260 3d4f445f2ac6437999c9bf8d17e1fd93
msgid ""
"route 指纹由 route id、模板内容哈希、结构输入内容哈希、规范化 conditions 和 progression "
"共同生成。场景身份还包含具体结构哈希、温度、压强和采样模型哈希。 因此修改模板或 route "
"条件后不能复用旧结果；完全相同的配置和内容可以确定性恢复。"
msgstr ""
"A route fingerprint combines the route ID, template-content hash, "
"structure-input content hash, normalized conditions, and progression. "
"Scenario identity also includes the structure hash, temperature, "
"pressure, and sampling-model hash. Results from an old template or route "
"condition therefore cannot be reused after a change; identical "
"configuration and content remain deterministically resumable."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:264 adabdfb470454554b5a9b6649061da3d
msgid "第一性原理标注与 k 点"
msgstr "First-principles labeling and k points"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:266 79d3fbd959d443fb8314ad5ff2fe0518
msgid "默认让用户输入文件管理 k 点："
msgstr "By default, let the user input file manage k points:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:268 ef5dd21275a44d8c9d6d87ed2b4e8353
msgid ""
"labeling:\n"
"  backend: vasp\n"
"  input_path: ./INCAR\n"
"  resource_path: /shared/potpaw_PBE\n"
"  potcar_manifest_path: ./vasp-resources.json\n"
"  kpoint_mode: auto\n"
"  structures_per_job: 1\n"
"  max_concurrent: 20\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:279 e1f134edee8847ff967f2c5751b3f46d
msgid ""
"`auto` 会优先保留 VASP INCAR 中的 `KSPACING`/`KGAMMA`，或 ABACUS INPUT 中的 "
"`kspacing`。输入中没有这些设置时，适配器才按默认参数生成网格。"
msgstr ""
"`auto` preserves `KSPACING`/`KGAMMA` in a VASP INCAR or `kspacing` in an "
"ABACUS INPUT. The adapter generates a grid from default parameters only "
"when those settings are absent."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:282 e43684984f8840ccbcf5a76639dfcdc2
msgid ""
"`structures_per_job` 决定每个 VASP/ABACUS 调度任务包含多少个 FPS 选中结构； "
"`max_concurrent` 限制 workflow 同时运行的标注任务数。默认值分别为 `1` 和 `20`。例如 FPS 选中 100 "
"个结构时，默认生成 100 个单结构任务，最多同时运行 20 个。Controller "
"只合并正常完成并通过标签校验的结构。任何失败或取消的标注任务 都会保存诊断后跳过，不再重试，也不会阻塞其余任务；最终结果仍按原始 FPS 顺序写入"
" `selected-labels.xyz`。如果本轮没有任何标注通过，workflow 会进入 `stalled`， 不会用空数据继续训练。"
msgstr ""
"`structures_per_job` controls how many FPS-selected structures go into "
"each scheduled VASP or ABACUS task; `max_concurrent` limits the number of"
" labeling tasks running at once. Their defaults are `1` and `20`. If FPS "
"selects 100 structures, the default creates 100 single-structure tasks "
"with at most 20 running concurrently. The Controller merges only "
"structures whose labeling tasks completed normally and passed label "
"validation. Every failed or cancelled labeling task is preserved for "
"diagnosis and skipped; it is not retried and does not block the remaining"
" tasks. Successful labels are still written to `selected-labels.xyz` in "
"the original FPS order. If no label passes validation, the workflow "
"enters `stalled` instead of continuing training with an empty dataset."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:290 6b26457837754b638e8823a3d307c379
msgid ""
"VASP 的 `potcar_manifest_path` 和 ABACUS 的 `resource_manifest_path` 是 必填 "
"provenance。它们固定逐元素资源相对路径与 SHA256；VASP 还固定精确 `TITEL`、family 和 "
"release。prepare 会先验证所有 sampling route 的元素覆盖， 本地 target "
"同时验证真实文件。远程资源库不打包上传，远程 labeling target 必须给出自己的绝对 "
"`labeling_resource_path`，并用 `doctor` 在提交前逐文件验证。 manifest 中 `Fe/POTCAR` 或 "
"`Fe_pv/POTCAR` 的 setup 目录会直接驱动 ASE 的 POTCAR 选择，校验路径和计算路径是同一个文件。"
msgstr ""
"VASP `potcar_manifest_path` and ABACUS `resource_manifest_path` are "
"required provenance. They pin per-element relative resource paths and "
"SHA256 hashes; VASP additionally pins the exact `TITEL`, family, and "
"release. Preparation first validates element coverage for every sampling "
"route, and a local target also validates the real files. Remote resource "
"libraries are not uploaded. A remote labeling target must provide its own"
" absolute `labeling_resource_path`, and `doctor` validates every file "
"before submission. A setup directory such as `Fe/POTCAR` or "
"`Fe_pv/POTCAR` in the manifest directly drives ASE POTCAR selection, so "
"the validated and calculated paths identify the same file."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:298 9e5904d719824d4c828a586034f1fd95
msgid "确实需要 NepTrain 接管时再显式配置："
msgstr "Configure an explicit override only when NepTrain must take control:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:300 eebe855c3fd9417f95cba7808a20ba09
msgid ""
"# 按间距设置\n"
"labeling:\n"
"  kpoint_mode: kspacing\n"
"  kspacing: 0.2\n"
"  gamma_centered: true\n"
"\n"
"# 或按网格密度参数设置\n"
"labeling:\n"
"  kpoint_mode: kpoints\n"
"  kpoints: [4, 4, 4]\n"
"  gamma_centered: true\n"
msgstr ""
"# Set by spacing\n"
"labeling:\n"
"  kpoint_mode: kspacing\n"
"  kspacing: 0.2\n"
"  gamma_centered: true\n"
"\n"
"# Or set by grid-density parameters\n"
"labeling:\n"
"  kpoint_mode: kpoints\n"
"  kpoints: [4, 4, 4]\n"
"  gamma_centered: true\n"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:314 0638229985874f67924e6b89521ecfc8
msgid ""
"`kspacing` 和 `kpoints` 不能同时配置。手动命令保持同样规则： `neptrain label --kspacing 0.2 "
"...` 或 `neptrain label --ka 4,4,4 ...`； 两者互斥。当前输入接口读取 INCAR/ABACUS INPUT "
"内的 k 点间距，不把同目录下 单独的 VASP `KPOINTS` 或 ABACUS `KPT` 文件作为自动 workflow 输入。"
msgstr ""
"`kspacing` and `kpoints` cannot be configured together. Standalone "
"commands follow the same rule: `neptrain label --kspacing 0.2 ...` and "
"`neptrain label --ka 4,4,4 ...` are mutually exclusive. The current input"
" interface reads k-point spacing from INCAR or ABACUS INPUT; it does not "
"treat a separate VASP `KPOINTS` or ABACUS `KPT` file in the same "
"directory as automatic workflow input."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:319 2e5153477f23497c87ca354b9eacab00
msgid "等变 Teacher 模型"
msgstr "Equivariant teacher models"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:321 eb8b777f2cef47b097a3c5a1eda341d5
msgid "当预训练或微调后的大模型直接替代 DFT 时，workflow stage 不变，只切换 Label Adapter："
msgstr ""
"When a pretrained or fine-tuned large model replaces DFT directly, keep "
"the workflow stages unchanged and switch only the Label Adapter:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:324 c79f36192eb5428b9c914e1c99307507
msgid ""
"labeling:\n"
"  backend: model\n"
"  model_path: ./mace-small.model\n"
"  model_name: mace-mp-0-small\n"
"  runner: neptrain model-worker mace\n"
"  device: cuda\n"
"  precision: float32\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:334 1f1e9391125240b8a1d82f9f4fa4157c
msgid ""
"`model_path` 会作为内容寻址输入进入 label task；`model_name`、模型 SHA256、 runner、device"
" 和 precision 会写入 `label-provenance.json`；extxyz 帧本身保留 标签来源、后端、模型名称和模型 "
"SHA256。runner 在 `execution.stage_targets.labeling` 指定的环境执行，因此 Teacher 框架的"
" PyTorch/CUDA 依赖不需要安装到 Controller 环境。"
msgstr ""
"`model_path` enters the label task as content-addressed input. "
"`model_name`, the model SHA256, runner, device, and precision are written"
" to `label-provenance.json`; each extxyz frame retains its label source, "
"backend, model name, and model SHA256. The runner executes in the "
"environment selected by `execution.stage_targets.labeling`, so the "
"Controller environment does not need the teacher framework’s PyTorch/CUDA"
" dependencies."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:340 4111d56243884ef295520deb3f65b4e3
msgid ""
"MACE 适配器由 `NepTrain[mace]` 提供，要求本地 checkpoint 文件和正体积周期 晶胞；它输出 "
"energy、forces 和按 `-stress × volume` 转换的 virial。MACE 不输出磁力，所以这个 runner 不支持"
" spin workflow。"
msgstr ""
"The MACE adapter is provided by `NepTrain[mace]` and requires a local "
"checkpoint plus a periodic cell with positive volume. It outputs energy, "
"forces, and virial converted as `-stress × volume`. MACE does not emit "
"magnetic forces, so this runner does not support spin workflows."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:344 298c8755d2fd4a628c30c50389d29c5a
msgid "DeepMD 适配器由 `NepTrain[deepmd]` 提供。DPA-3 多任务模型可写成："
msgstr ""
"The DeepMD adapter is provided by `NepTrain[deepmd]`. A multitask DPA-3 "
"model can be configured as:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:346 3b21f7e0f6d34e8fafd7767c33307ba8
msgid ""
"labeling:\n"
"  backend: model\n"
"  model_path: ./DPA-3.2-5M.pt\n"
"  model_name: dpa-3.2-5m-omol25\n"
"  runner: neptrain model-worker deepmd --head OMol25\n"
"  device: cuda\n"
"  precision: float32\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:356 7e8c6108e87640e09c98d07b0ea0cedf
msgid ""
"DPA-4 使用相同 runner 和本地 `.pt2` 模型；不新增 workflow backend。模型格式、 head 和推理后端由 "
"DeePMD-kit 处理，NepTrain 仍按本地文件内容记录 SHA256。 当前 DPA-4 要求 DeePMD-kit 3.2 "
"或更新版本。DeepMD runner 同样不生成 `mforce`，因此不支持 spin workflow。"
msgstr ""
"DPA-4 uses the same runner with a local `.pt2` model; it does not add "
"another workflow backend. DeePMD-kit handles model format, head, and "
"inference backend, while NepTrain records the local file’s SHA256. DPA-4 "
"currently requires DeePMD-kit 3.2 or later. The DeepMD runner also does "
"not emit `mforce` and therefore does not support spin workflows."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:361 229aafdd56dc4e67855acee4b70f4744
msgid "TACE runner 复用官方 `tace-eval` 批量推理，并把它写出的预测 extxyz 归一成 NepTrain 标签："
msgstr ""
"The TACE runner reuses the official `tace-eval` batch inference command "
"and normalizes its prediction extxyz into NepTrain labels:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:364 3b21f7e0f6d34e8fafd7767c33307ba8
msgid ""
"labeling:\n"
"  backend: model\n"
"  model_path: ./TACE-OAM-7M.pt\n"
"  model_name: TACE-OAM-7M\n"
"  runner: neptrain model-worker tace --fidelity-index 0\n"
"  device: cuda\n"
"  precision: float32\n"
msgstr ""
"labeling:\n"
"  backend: model\n"
"  model_path: ./TACE-OAM-7M.pt\n"
"  model_name: TACE-OAM-7M\n"
"  runner: neptrain model-worker tace --fidelity-index 0\n"
"  device: cuda\n"
"  precision: float32\n"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:374 e019b1daade8489c99f2371579b75c85
msgid ""
"`--fidelity-index` 会写入传给 TACE 的临时输入结构；省略时保留模型或输入的默认 fidelity。NepTrain "
"要求模型至少输出 energy、forces，以及 stress 或 virial。 stress 会按 `-stress × volume` "
"转为 virial，TACE 直接输出的 virial 则原样保留。 普通 TACE checkpoint 不能标注 spin 数据；只有真实输出"
" `noncollinear_magnetic_forces` 的模型才会被映射为标准 `mforce`。"
msgstr ""
"`--fidelity-index` is written into the temporary input structures passed "
"to TACE; omit it to keep the model or input default. NepTrain requires at"
" least energy, forces, and either stress or virial. Stress is converted "
"as `-stress × volume`, while a virial emitted directly by TACE is "
"preserved. An ordinary TACE checkpoint cannot label spin data; only a "
"model that actually emits `noncollinear_magnetic_forces` is mapped to "
"canonical `mforce`."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:380 ca05ccc9d8de482289518ba80a1cce0d
msgid ""
"这里的 `model-worker` 是 label stage 的内部协议，不是独立产品入口；用户仍通过 `neptrain label` 或 "
"workflow 启动标注。"
msgstr ""
"`model-worker` is an internal protocol for the label stage, not a "
"separate product entry point. Users still start labeling through "
"`neptrain label` or a workflow."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:383 131ce27ac7c6471392200bdd2ce768cc
msgid ""
"这一路径在调度上完全替代 DFT，但报告会保留 `teacher_model` 来源，避免把蒸馏 标签误称为 DFT 标签。若配置独立 "
"`evaluation.validation_path`，最终验收仍以该 参考集为准。"
msgstr ""
"This path replaces DFT at scheduling time, but reports retain the "
"`teacher_model` source so distilled labels are not mislabeled as DFT "
"labels. If an independent `evaluation.validation_path` is configured, "
"final acceptance still uses that reference set."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:387 d6d2b8850a2448e3934aa6f8f4d28371
msgid "准备和运行"
msgstr "Prepare and run"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:389 d78f54d8c37d417db550dfb7d35431df
msgid ""
"neptrain workflow run project.yaml --prepare-only\n"
"neptrain workflow run fe-workflow\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:394 6754ee66ce7a4a3c8dda368311b647a7
msgid ""
"第一条命令只创建不可变输入快照，返回的 `next_action` 可以直接复制执行。 不需要人工检查快照时，也可以直接运行 `neptrain "
"workflow run project.yaml`，一次完成创建和启动。"
msgstr ""
"The first command creates only an immutable input snapshot, and its "
"returned `next_action` can be copied and run directly. If manual snapshot"
" inspection is unnecessary, run `neptrain workflow run project.yaml` to "
"create and start the workflow in one step."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:398 1a32954ef99f4bb2a61c4e07e3f57bbe
msgid "输出目录默认使用 `workflow.id`。Controller 默认脱离终端，按 ledger 推进："
msgstr ""
"The output directory defaults to `workflow.id`. The Controller detaches "
"from the terminal by default and advances from the ledger:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:400 43f7e7c79b8149eea660b2d14721a553
msgid "train → explore → select → label → diagnose → merge → retrain → evaluate\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:404 90d30f8355704b4382826a3075bd6e40
msgid "训练、MD 和 labeling stage 使用与独立命令相同的 Adapter 和 execution target。"
msgstr ""
"Training, MD, and labeling stages use the same adapters and execution "
"targets as standalone commands."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:406 f0bfc98e955a45d1b9a00e5a368c2001
msgid ""
"`workflow run <目录>` 只允许状态为 `prepared` 的目录第一次启动。 `workflow resume <目录>` "
"只用于已经启动过的暂停、失败、中断或可修复损坏状态； 对 prepared 目录会明确要求使用 `run`。失败目录再次执行 `run` "
"也会被拒绝并指向 `resume`，因此“首次启动”和“恢复”不会共享一条含糊路径。"
msgstr ""
"`workflow run <directory>` starts a directory only when its state is "
"`prepared`. `workflow resume <directory>` is only for workflows that have"
" already started and are paused, failed, interrupted, or repairably "
"damaged; a prepared directory explicitly directs you to `run`. Running "
"`run` again on a failed directory is also rejected and points to "
"`resume`, so first start and recovery do not share an ambiguous path."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:411 c26716ec4ce9421593f914130f247b9f
msgid "状态与恢复"
msgstr "Status and recovery"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:413 3feb3d8a6a634147afa4f1fa3d69aae3
msgid ""
"neptrain workflow status fe-workflow\n"
"neptrain workflow status fe-workflow --jobs\n"
"neptrain workflow resume fe-workflow\n"
"neptrain workflow stop fe-workflow\n"
"neptrain workflow extend fe-workflow 5\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:421 d2bf485c67a044d89f20335c4226eaad
msgid "默认状态页优先显示当前代次、采样温度路径、实际 MD 进度和历代验证精度。例如："
msgstr ""
"By default, the status page prioritizes the current generation, sampling "
"temperature path, actual MD progress, and validation accuracy by "
"generation. For example:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:423 ef925ed8cc684ac485639176e601a51f
msgid ""
"NepTrain · Fe-spin\n"
"路径：/work/neptrain/Fe-spin\n"
"状态：运行中 | 第 3/6 代 | 采样中\n"
"更新：14:32:08（8 秒前）\n"
"\n"
"采样进度：\n"
"300 K ✓ → 500 K ● 3.2/10 ps（2/4 条轨迹完成）→ 700 K ○\n"
"\n"
"验证集精度：\n"
"代    状态    E/meV·atom⁻¹  F/meV·Å⁻¹    V/meV·atom⁻¹  M/meV/μB    验收\n"
"G1    完成    18.0           210           41.0           168          通过\n"
"G2    完成    14.2 ↓21%      176 ↓16%      35.0 ↓15%      149 ↓11%     通过\n"
"G3    采样中  -             -             -             -            等待\n"
msgstr ""
"NepTrain · Fe-spin\n"
"Path: /work/neptrain/Fe-spin\n"
"State: running | generation 3/6 | sampling\n"
"Updated: 14:32:08 (8 seconds ago)\n"
"\n"
"Sampling progress:\n"
"300 K ✓ → 500 K ● 3.2/10 ps (2/4 trajectories complete) → 700 K ○\n"
"\n"
"Validation accuracy:\n"
"Gen   State     E/meV·atom⁻¹  F/meV·Å⁻¹    V/meV·atom⁻¹  M/meV/μB    "
"Acceptance\n"
"G1    complete  18.0           210           41.0           168          "
"pass\n"
"G2    complete  14.2 ↓21%      176 ↓16%      35.0 ↓15%      149 ↓11%     "
"pass\n"
"G3    sampling  -              -             -              -            "
"waiting\n"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:439 c02695fcffbc4479a66ee94b498e7d57
msgid ""
"ps 进度来自 MD 已写出的实际 step 和模板中的有效 timestep，不使用墙钟时间估算； 远端文件暂时不可见时会明确显示“ps "
"暂不可读”。未配置独立验证集时，状态页不把 训练误差冒充为泛化精度；若配置了 `workflow.convergence`，这里改为显示旧模型对 "
"本轮新增 DFT 标签的训练前误差，否则显示“暂无可比较数据”。"
msgstr ""
"Progress in ps comes from the actual MD step written to the trajectory "
"and the effective timestep in the template, not from wall-clock "
"estimates. When a remote file is temporarily unavailable, the page "
"explicitly reports that ps progress cannot be read. Without independent "
"validation, the status page does not present training error as "
"generalization accuracy. If `workflow.convergence` is configured, it "
"instead shows the old model's pre-training error on the current "
"generation's new DFT labels; otherwise it reports that no comparable data"
" are available."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:444 1be2785066b34339af899dffd203d786
msgid ""
"`--jobs` 按“代次 + 阶段 + attempt”压缩同一批任务。即使同时运行 20 个 MD 或 100 个 DFT "
"标注任务，也只显示每批的完成、运行、等待和失败计数；逐任务结构仍 完整保留在 `--json` 输出中。"
msgstr ""
"`--jobs` groups a batch by generation, stage, and attempt. Even with 20 "
"MD or 100 DFT labeling tasks running concurrently, it shows only the "
"complete, running, pending, and failed counts for each batch. Per-task "
"details remain available in full in the `--json` output."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:448 9e982c1b005d4bd08530b535f3e16dba
msgid ""
"`workflow status --json` 的 stdout 使用 `neptrain.workflow-"
"status.v1`；run/resume、stop 和 extend 分别使用稳定的 `workflow-control.v1"
"`、`workflow-stop.v1` 和 `workflow-extend.v1`。诊断不混入 JSON stdout。`workflow-"
"control.v1` 始终包含 `workflow_id`、`project`、 `manifest` 和 `action`；`action` "
"明确区分 `prepare`、`start`、`resume`、 `repair` 与 `noop`，不再另写一份重复的 `started` "
"布尔状态。"
msgstr ""
"`workflow status --json` writes `neptrain.workflow-status.v1` to stdout. "
"Run/resume, stop, and extend use the stable `workflow-control.v1`, "
"`workflow-stop.v1`, and `workflow-extend.v1` protocols. Diagnostics never"
" contaminate JSON stdout. `workflow-control.v1` always includes "
"`workflow_id`, `project`, `manifest`, and `action`; `action` "
"distinguishes `prepare`, `start`, `resume`, `repair`, and `noop`, "
"replacing a redundant `started` Boolean."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:455 fe12ab3f7bda44ed94bb574ad7c308fe
msgid ""
"Controller 不依赖 Slurm `afterok`。失败后只重跑 ledger 中未完成的阶段；已完成 workflow 使用 "
"`resume` 是安全 no-op。`workflow run` 接受项目 YAML 或 workflow 目录：对尚未启动的准备目录返回 "
"`action: start`；`workflow resume` 用于暂停、 失败或中断后的恢复。"
msgstr ""
"The Controller does not depend on Slurm `afterok`. After failure, it "
"reruns only stages not committed in the ledger; `resume` on a completed "
"workflow is a safe no-op. `workflow run` accepts a project YAML or "
"workflow directory and returns `action: start` for a prepared directory "
"that has not started. Use `workflow resume` after pause, failure, or "
"interruption."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:460 686b9d5409364476912bdb0f32d31167
msgid "状态语义如下："
msgstr "State semantics are:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:462 bb43630f43174fdbb2bdaeb6465de978
msgid "`prepared`：只有不可变输入快照，下一步是 `workflow run`。"
msgstr ""
"`prepared`: only the immutable input snapshot exists; run `workflow run` "
"next."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:463 17509f15401b49f69cde7c342ec903a2
msgid "`running`：Controller lock 存在且当前任务可观察。"
msgstr "`running`: the Controller lock exists and the current task is observable."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:464 ceb930f1caaa40c8a61fd56eb289d5a0
msgid ""
"`degraded`：临时 SSH/scheduler 查询失败，Controller 保留原 handle 并重试； "
"连接恢复后自动继续，不会把传输故障冒充为计算失败。只有 scheduler 明确返回 失败、取消或确认任务丢失时，才进入 `failed`。"
msgstr ""
"`degraded`: a temporary SSH or scheduler query failed; the Controller "
"retains the original handle and retries. It resumes automatically after "
"the connection recovers and does not present a transport outage as a "
"compute failure. It enters `failed` only after the scheduler explicitly "
"reports a failure or cancellation, or confirms that the task was lost."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:467 6eec7308ecef4c528a3e995450d9a24f
msgid "`paused`：Controller 已停止或 PID/lock 不在，但远端工作和 current intent 保留。"
msgstr ""
"`paused`: the Controller stopped or its PID/lock is absent, but remote "
"work and current intent remain."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:468 93ac19daec6641ab81dae78ff41a2ede
msgid "`failed` / `rejected`：执行失败或科学验收失败，可按记录创建新 attempt 恢复。"
msgstr ""
"`failed` / `rejected`: execution or scientific acceptance failed; "
"recovery may create a new recorded attempt."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:469 466cdb163ee941a182d7c18639ff02e4
msgid ""
"`damaged`：已提交 artifact、ledger 或 publication 不满足 hash/身份契约。 resume 只修复 "
"hash 一致的冗余副本和可见投影；无法证明来源时在提交新任务前 fail closed。"
msgstr ""
"`damaged`: a committed artifact, ledger, or publication violates its hash"
" or identity contract. Resume repairs only hash-identical redundant "
"copies and visible projections; when provenance cannot be proven, it "
"fails closed before submitting any new task."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:472 945e2a2d9cf142b0a7417511e0e2ec0a
msgid "`budget_exhausted`：模型代数预算耗尽，先 `workflow extend`，不是成功。"
msgstr ""
"`budget_exhausted`: the model-generation budget is exhausted. Run "
"`workflow extend`; this is not success."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:473 ae68c9b1b64b4818bb93e77e7bb7ba82
msgid "`stalled`：相同模型与策略继续运行不会增加证据；必须修改科学策略并新建 workflow，不能原样 retry。"
msgstr ""
"`stalled`: continuing with the same model and policy cannot add evidence."
" Change the scientific policy and create a new workflow instead of "
"retrying unchanged."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:475 9f750ce6e3cd4cc4812adc103611edcf
msgid "`complete`：完整 stage 链和（若配置）独立 validation 已验收。"
msgstr ""
"`complete`: the full stage chain and independent validation, when "
"configured, have passed acceptance."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:477 4bb1982c36c84b0ebeec5e7b1ee5d465
msgid ""
"`workflow.max_model_generations` 是采样代预算，不包含自动预留的最终训练代，也不是 成功条件。配置 "
"`evaluation` 时，最终训练代还必须通过独立 validation 才能完成。 预算用尽但仍未收敛时状态为 "
"`budget_exhausted`，连续两轮没有 新覆盖或模型改进时状态为 `stalled`，都不会伪装成 `complete`。"
msgstr ""
"`workflow.max_model_generations` is the acquisition-generation budget; it "
"does not include the automatically reserved final training generation and is "
"not a success condition. With `evaluation` configured, the finalization model "
"must also pass independent validation. If the budget ends before convergence, "
"the state is `budget_exhausted`; if two consecutive rounds add no coverage or "
"model improvement, it is `stalled`. Neither is presented as `complete`."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:482 f045acb94e6a48279e30c2670e743689
msgid ""
"`evaluation` 可以整块省略。此时 workflow 仍可采样、标注、重训和记录场景证据， 但 "
"`validation_accepted` 保持为空，流程不会伪造 validation passed，也不会把 该模型标成已完成独立验证。"
msgstr ""
"The entire `evaluation` section is optional. Without it, the workflow can"
" still sample, label, retrain, and record scenario evidence, but "
"`validation_accepted` remains empty; the workflow neither fabricates a "
"validation pass nor marks the model as independently validated."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:486 c0f94c606f2444a78cb63c60a7e8a7f1
msgid "默认停止 Controller，并取消当前 process 或 Slurm 作业："
msgstr ""
"By default, stop the Controller and cancel the current process or Slurm "
"jobs:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:488 ea48e2ec410743bc97c95aad3a6cfe73
msgid "neptrain workflow stop fe-workflow\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:492 1bda64bf3cc84fea85b97b6ed65a000c
msgid "如果只想暂时退出 Controller，并让当前计算任务继续运行："
msgstr ""
"To stop only the Controller while allowing current compute jobs to "
"continue:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:494 c09d60bb83e74e4ab4669213b3499979
msgid "neptrain workflow stop fe-workflow --keep-jobs\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:498 6abcac7f34af4a4f9a00dbda805a6d67
msgid ""
"取消动作会记录到 workflow 历史；后续恢复会创建新的 stage attempt。 对 task group，已完成且通过校验的 "
"shard 保留原 task id；只有未完成、取消或 缺失 shard 生成新 attempt。`--keep-jobs` 仅停止 "
"Controller，下一次 resume 先重新观察原 job handle，不重复提交。作业已离开 `squeue` 时还会查询 "
"accounting； 超过有界 grace 仍不存在才按 LOST 处理。"
msgstr ""
"Cancellation is recorded in workflow history, and a later recovery "
"creates a new stage attempt. In a task group, completed and verified "
"shards retain their task IDs; only unfinished, cancelled, or missing "
"shards receive a new attempt. `--keep-jobs` stops only the Controller, so"
" the next resume observes the existing job handle before considering "
"resubmission. Jobs that leave `squeue` are still checked through "
"accounting and become LOST only after a bounded grace period."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:504 c43c6844454f43e58f12baa58fb6282f
msgid "每代目录直接对应用户关心的阶段："
msgstr "Each generation directory maps directly to the stages users inspect:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:506 baef258585744b3188e31534afef78d3
msgid ""
"generations/0001/\n"
"├── train/\n"
"├── md/\n"
"├── select/\n"
"├── label/\n"
"├── diagnose/\n"
"├── dataset/\n"
"├── retrain/\n"
"└── evaluate/\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:518 315453b79f634e1c82e1d9f702e23733
msgid ""
"训练模型、loss 和 stdout/stderr 等关键产物会发布到对应阶段目录； `calculation` "
"软链指向真实执行目录，便于直接排查。训练完成后会用 Matplotlib 从 `loss.out` 自动生成 `training-"
"convergence.png` 和可审计的 `training-report.json`。配置独立验证集时，evaluate "
"还会生成按验收阈值归一化的 `evaluation-metrics.png` 与 `evaluation-report.json`；图中 1× "
"线就是配置阈值。 同一轮预测还会生成 Energy、Force、Virial 的 reference/prediction parity 图 "
"`evaluation-parity.png`，spin 模型会增加 magnetic-force 面板。对应报告记录 "
"validation/model hash、总点数、实际绘制点数和 RMSE；大数组只对显示点做确定性 抽样，RMSE 仍使用全部有限数据。"
msgstr ""
"Trained models, loss, stdout/stderr, and other key artifacts are "
"published to their stage directories; a `calculation` symlink points to "
"the actual execution directory for direct diagnosis. After training, "
"Matplotlib reads `loss.out` and writes `training-convergence.png` plus an"
" auditable `training-report.json`. With independent validation "
"configured, evaluation also writes threshold-normalized `evaluation-"
"metrics.png` and `evaluation-report.json`; the 1× line is the configured "
"threshold. The same predictions produce an Energy, Force, and Virial "
"reference/prediction parity plot in `evaluation-parity.png`, with a "
"magnetic-force panel for spin models. Reports record validation/model "
"hashes, total points, displayed points, and RMSE. Large arrays are "
"sampled deterministically for display only; RMSE still uses all finite "
"values."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:528 bc76ff358ecb461cba312c64f49c9c1d
msgid "内部 job 也只保留一层输入和一层输出。job 名称已经包含代数、阶段、route、 attempt 和任务指纹，因此输出目录不再重复这些信息："
msgstr ""
"Internal jobs also keep only one input layer and one output layer. Job "
"names already include generation, stage, route, attempt, and task "
"fingerprint, so output paths do not repeat them:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:531 b2621b8d1f4446f99f2304eb5bdb61be
msgid ""
".neptrain/jobs/g0001-md-default-.../\n"
"├── input/\n"
"├── output/\n"
"│   ├── log.lammps\n"
"│   ├── trajectory.xyz\n"
"│   ├── candidates.xyz\n"
"│   └── md-attempts.json\n"
"├── task.json\n"
"├── execution.json\n"
"└── result.json\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:544 4b27cfcbb5f94d59bc2ee62d1e21b051
msgid ""
"训练的 `nep.txt`、`loss.out`、checkpoint 和训练日志同样直接位于该 job 的 `output/`。默认的单结构 "
"VASP/ABACUS job 也把输入、原生输出、后端日志和 `selected-labels.xyz` 直接放在 "
"`output/`；只有发生真实重试时才出现 `retry-0002/`。每代 `label/` 直接发布 `000001-Ce8Fe16` "
"等软链及最终合并文件， 不再增加 `teacher/`、`attempt-0001/` 或 `calculations/` 层。`input/` "
"也只携带当前阶段真正消费的文件：训练任务不再 复制 MD route，MD 和标注任务不再复制初始训练集及 validation 数据。"
msgstr ""
"The training `nep.txt`, `loss.out`, checkpoint, and logs live directly in"
" that job’s `output/`. A default single-structure VASP or ABACUS job "
"likewise keeps inputs, native outputs, backend logs, and `selected-"
"labels.xyz` directly in `output/`; `retry-0002/` appears only after a "
"real retry. Each generation’s `label/` publishes symlinks such as "
"`000001-Ce8Fe16` and the final merged file directly, without extra "
"`teacher/`, `attempt-0001/`, or `calculations/` layers. `input/` carries "
"only files consumed by that stage: training tasks no longer copy MD "
"routes, and MD or labeling tasks no longer copy the initial training set "
"or validation data."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:551 988ad2841ca1408098917ae5a56436b5
msgid ""
"远端 task 使用内容寻址协议：本地先在临时目录完整生成 `task.json` 和全部输入， 校验 manifest 后打包；远端在独占 "
"lock 下解包、复核 hash，再用一次 rename 发布，worker 不会看到半上传 bundle。结果先写到临时 "
"`output`，完成后原子切换并 发布绑定 task id/spec hash 的 `result.json`；收集端只接受属于当前 "
"workflow instance 的完整结果。旧 workflow 目录删除后重新创建会得到新的随机 "
"`instance_id`，即使配置相同也不能复用旧远端结果。"
msgstr ""
"Remote tasks use a content-addressed protocol. Locally, NepTrain first "
"creates `task.json` and every input in a temporary directory, validates "
"the manifest, and archives it. Remotely, it extracts under an exclusive "
"lock, verifies hashes, and publishes with one rename, so a worker never "
"sees a partially uploaded bundle. Results are written to a temporary "
"`output`, switched atomically, and published with a `result.json` bound "
"to the task ID and specification hash. Collection accepts only complete "
"results belonging to the current workflow instance. Recreating a deleted "
"workflow directory produces a new random `instance_id`; even identical "
"configuration cannot reuse results from the old remote workflow."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:558 b1eb30e899d24373856c3c4c17273377
msgid "状态权威与目录恢复"
msgstr "Authoritative state and directory recovery"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:560 426090256c69430fafe1c697cdc7b914
msgid "`.neptrain/manifest.json` 只固定 prepare 输入、计划和 workflow instance。"
msgstr ""
"`.neptrain/manifest.json` pins only prepared inputs, plans, and the "
"workflow instance."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:561 73850eebad0a44549c25cb40f5f2e761
msgid "`.neptrain/ledger.json` 是已提交科学阶段的唯一权威和 commit point。"
msgstr ""
"`.neptrain/ledger.json` is the sole authority and commit point for "
"committed scientific stages."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:562 f58cd92a996249cf86e2927f8955664f
msgid ""
"`.neptrain/controller.json` 只保存 attempt、current execution、job handle、 "
"取消与恢复 intent。"
msgstr ""
"`.neptrain/controller.json` stores only attempts, current execution, job "
"handles, cancellation, and recovery intent."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:564 ce09b0150861417888c5c1bcddfd44ea
msgid ""
"job 内 `task.json` 是不可变输入；`execution.json` 是运行观察； `result.json` "
"是通过收集校验前的候选结果。"
msgstr ""
"Within a job, `task.json` is immutable input, `execution.json` is runtime"
" observation, and `result.json` is a candidate result before collection "
"validation."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:566 06d753e12a8d432188939ed0b088694c
msgid ""
"`results/accepted/` 保存不可变发布；`results/current`、根部结果链接和 "
"`generations/*/calculation` 是相对链接投影，可由权威记录重建。"
msgstr ""
"`results/accepted/` stores immutable publications. `results/current`, "
"root result links, and `generations/*/calculation` are relative-link "
"projections that can be rebuilt from authoritative records."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:569 5a5c7bc0b50d41e3bd19d14327a56676
msgid ""
"因此，删除可见链接不会丢失科学状态，`resume` 可修复。删除一个有 hash 冗余副本 的 stage artifact 时，resume "
"只会复制完全相同的已验证内容；找不到一致副本、 ledger 缺失、publication 唯一副本损坏或 artifact 路径逃出 "
"workflow 时，状态保持 `damaged`，不会自动回退成 prepared 或启动下游阶段。要彻底重跑请创建新目录， 不要删除 "
"`.neptrain` 或手工编辑 JSON 来“重置”。"
msgstr ""
"Deleting visible links therefore does not lose scientific state; `resume`"
" can repair them. If a stage artifact with a hash-identical redundant "
"copy is removed, resume copies only the exact verified content. If no "
"identical copy exists, the ledger is missing, the only publication copy "
"is damaged, or an artifact path escapes the workflow, the state remains "
"`damaged`; it never falls back to prepared or starts downstream work. To "
"rerun from scratch, create a new directory instead of deleting "
"`.neptrain` or editing JSON by hand to “reset” the workflow."

